/-!
# Kernel structure and the geometric route to selected octad fusion

The literal octad restriction kernel is identified with the shortened-Golay
semidirect product, and its order is proved to be 512. The geometric interface
uses actual conjugation on its central quotient and supplies the cyclic lifting
step back to the literal octad action image.

Extraspeciality, construction of the orthogonal realization, and conjugacy of
the anisotropic-plane cubic rotations remain separate mathematical obligations.
This module does not yet assert unconditional quaternion image fusion.

Source: Aschbacher, *Sporadic Groups* (1994), 25.1–25.5 and §46, p.251.
-/
